@startuml ui-gesture-input-data-flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam activityFontSize 12

title 筷子输入法 - 用户手势输入数据流\nUser Gesture Input Data Flow

|GestureInputPanel|
start
:接收触摸事件;
:归一化: eventX/panelWidth → OffsetF;
:写入 GestureFeedbackState (归一化坐标);

|GestureFeedbackState|
:touchTrailPoints\nList<OffsetF>\npressedKeys\nSet<InputKey>;

|GestureFeedbackPanel|
:反归一化: OffsetF × panelSize → Offset;
:绘制触摸轨迹、手指指示器;

|GestureInputPanel|
:查询 KeyLayoutState.findKeyAt();
:输出 InputGesture;

|KeyboardViewModel|
:handleGesture();
:gestureToIntent() 转换;

|ImeEngine|
:handleIntent(ImeIntent);
:reduce(state, intent);

|ImeState|
:keyboard.state / inputList\ncandidateList / config\nkeyboard.mode;

|ImeEffect|
:PopupTip / PlayAudio\nConfirmFavorite;

|KeyboardViewModel|
:订阅 ImeEffect → PopupTipState\n派生 isInputting (inputList.hasPending)\n维护 ToolListState (local);

|Compose UI|
:collectAsState() 驱动重组;
:keyboard.mode → KeyLayoutPanel\nisInputting → ToolListPanel/InputListPanel\npopupTipState → PopupTipPanel\ntoolListState → ToolListPanel\ncandidateList → CandidateListPanel\ninputList → InputListPanel;

stop

legend right
    |= 颜色 |= 含义 |
    |<#E8F5E9>| :ime-ui 层 |
    |<#FFF3E0>| :ime-engine 层 |
endlegend

@enduml
